# Local Development
#
# OpenBao is the only external secret authority. Do not create a populated
# .env file. Use repository wrappers or export a narrowly scoped value from a
# current human OpenBao OIDC session into the one command that needs it.
#
# Required local values:
#   DATABASE_URL          - Set automatically by docker compose
#   SESSION_SECRET    - Session signing secret
#   KUBE_API_URL          - Kubernetes API server URL
#   KUBE_TOKEN            - ServiceAccount bearer token
#   CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN  - Cloudflare API token (for DNS)
#   CLOUDFLARE_ZONE_ID    - Cloudflare zone ID
#
# See docs/SECRETS.md for the authority and delivery model.
